2026-07-24 17:06:46 | llm | default_trace_id | INFO | {"event_id": "e7bef0f2-0dde-4ea4-bbb0-85c5356c326f", "event_type": "llm_call_end", "log_level": "INFO", "timestamp": "2026-07-24T17:06:46.666680+08:00", "module_type": "llm", "module_id": "llm", "module_name": "llm", "status": "success", "message": "OpenAI API response received.", "metadata": {"response": "ChatCompletion(id='chatcmpl-93cf9783c5e57057', choices=[Choice(finish_reason='stop', index=0, logprobs=None, message=ChatCompletionMessage(content='{\\n  \"needs_deep\": true,\\n  \"verdict\": \"suspicious\",\\n  \"confidence\": 0.6,\\n  \"rationale\": \"DCSync 操作虽由机器账号发起，但必须验证该账号是否拥有目录复制权限、操作对象是否为域控、以及是否存在异常的登录会话或进程链，否则无法区分是正常运维还是攻击者利用合法凭证。\"\\n}', refusal=None, role='assistant', annotations=None, audio=None, function_call=None, tool_calls=[], reasoning=None), stop_reason=None, token_ids=None)], created=1784884002, model='qwen3.5-9b', object='chat.completion', moderation=None, service_tier=None, system_fingerprint=None, usage=CompletionUsage(completion_tokens=90, prompt_tokens=2149, total_tokens=2239, completion_tokens_details=None, prompt_tokens_details=None), prompt_logprobs=None, prompt_token_ids=None, kv_transfer_params=None)"}, "model_name": "qwen3.5-9b", "model_provider": "OpenAI", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "你是 SOC 一线告警分诊器。只给你**这一条告警的原文和元数据**(payload/签名/规则/内容都在里面)。\n\n核心原则:**只有当'深度取证(查主机行为/进程链/登录序列/该实体台账)能提供改变结论的信息'时,升级才有意义。** 光凭告警自身就能定'是攻击还是良性'、深度取证只是补细节(扇出/估值/落地)的,直接判、别升级。\n\n1) 告警自身的签名/内容/payload 就足以定性 → 给 verdict、needs_deep=false:\n   · 良性(false_positive):证书申请字段无效/缺失报错;已知代理/供给工具例行操作(Ansible win_copy、Wazuh 代理);PowerShell 策略自检(__PSScriptPolicyTest)。\n   · 攻击(true_positive):RC4 加密的 Kerberoast 取票;非域控机器账号发起的 DCSync/目录复制;WAF 拦下的明确 SQLi/XSS 注入串;已知恶意工具/载荷签名。\n   —— 这类升级到深度也只补扇出/估值等细节,不改'攻击/良性'的结论,**不必升级**。\n2) 必须重建**主机行为 / 进程父子链 / 登录序列 / 跨层落地**才能定的 → needs_deep=true(verdict=\"suspicious\"):\n   · 一条网络登录,不知源/会话/该账号基线,无法区分正常 vs 横向;\n   · 可疑进程要看父子链、命令行上下文才知恶意与否;\n   · webshell/上传要看后端是否落地(写文件/派生进程/外连)。\n3) 真拿不准 → needs_deep=true。别硬判。\n\n只输出 JSON,不要多余解释。"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Carefully consider the user's question to ensure your answer is logical and makes sense.\n- Make sure your explanation is concise and easy to understand, not verbose.\n- Strictly return the answer in valid JSON format only, and \"DO NOT ADD ANY COMMENTS BEFORE OR AFTER IT\" to ensure it could be formatted as a JSON instance that conforms to the JSON schema below.\nHere is the JSON schema: {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"needs_deep\": {\"type\": \"boolean\", \"description\": \"true=需深度研判(要重建主机行为/进程链/登录序列才能定);false=光凭告警就能终局\"}, \"verdict\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"true_positive\", \"false_positive\", \"suspicious\"], \"description\": \"needs_deep=false 时给 true_positive 或 false_positive;true 时给 suspicious\"}, \"confidence\": {\"type\": \"number\", \"description\": \"对判定的置信 0~1\"}, \"rationale\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"一句话依据\"}}, \"required\": [\"needs_deep\", \"verdict\"]}.\nThe question is: {\"alert_uid\": \"e324f308faf659d50d341a6262a98b3ad913b7a856121f5a4a75ca88146140a0\", \"rule_description\": \"Possible DCSync: directory replication rights access by KINGSLANDING$\", \"source\": \"wazuh\", \"sensor\": \"wazuh-hids\", \"severity\": 8, \"technique_ids\": [\"T1003.006\"], \"raw\": \"{\\\"@timestamp\\\": \\\"2026-07-14T14:11:59.005Z\\\", \\\"log\\\": {\\\"offset\\\": 128922822, \\\"file\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/logs/wazuh/alerts.json\\\"}}, \\\"location\\\": \\\"EventChannel\\\", \\\"rule\\\": {\\\"level\\\": 8, \\\"description\\\": \\\"Possible DCSync: directory replication rights access by KINGSLANDING$\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"100807\\\", \\\"mitre\\\": {\\\"id\\\": [\\\"T1003.006\\\"], \\\"tactic\\\": [\\\"Credential Access\\\"], \\\"technique\\\": [\\\"DCSync\\\"]}, \\\"firedtimes\\\": 1, \\\"mail\\\": false, \\\"groups\\\": [\\\"local\\\", \\\"soc\\\", \\\"windows\\\"]}, \\\"log_type\\\": \\\"hids_alert\\\", \\\"ecs\\\": {\\\"version\\\": \\\"1.12.0\\\"}, \\\"manager\\\": {\\\"name\\\": \\\"e5bb7343f06d\\\"}, \\\"decoder\\\": {\\\"name\\\": \\\"windows_eventchannel\\\"}, \\\"agent\\\": {\\\"id\\\": \\\"003\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"kingslanding\\\", \\\"ip\\\": \\\"192.168.56.10\\\", \\\"type\\\": \\\"filebeat\\\", \\\"version\\\": \\\"7.17.22\\\", \\\"hostname\\\": \\\"f8e24743dcc1\\\", \\\"ephemeral_id\\\": \\\"d5d271ec-e831-42dd-9d03-45d8ccd7a05b\\\"}, \\\"id\\\": \\\"1784038316.232393109\\\", \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"2026-07-14T14:11:56.804+0000\\\", \\\"host\\\": {\\\"name\\\": \\\"f8e24743dcc1\\\"}, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"win\\\": {\\\"eventdata\\\": {\\\"operationType\\\": \\\"Object Access\\\", \\\"properties\\\": \\\"%%7688    {1131f6aa-9c07-11d1-f79f-00c04fc2dcd2}   {19195a5b-6da0-11d0-afd3-00c04fd930c9}\\\", \\\"subjectUserName\\\": \\\"KINGSLANDING$\\\", \\\"subjectDomainName\\\": \\\"SEVENKINGDOMS\\\", \\\"accessList\\\": \\\"%%7688\\\", \\\"accessMask\\\": \\\"0x100\\\", \\\"objectServer\\\": \\\"DS\\\", \\\"objectName\\\": \\\"%{23a162f2-a634-48bd-89aa-714518b48d06}\\\", \\\"handleId\\\": \\\"0x0\\\", \\\"subjectUserSid\\\": \\\"S-1-5-18\\\", \\\"subjectLogonId\\\": \\\"0x1220b8\\\", \\\"objectType\\\": \\\"%{19195a5b-6da0-11d0-afd3-00c04fd930c9}\\\"}, \\\"system\\\": {\\\"opcode\\\": \\\"0\\\", \\\"eventRecordID\\\": \\\"272585\\\", \\\"computer\\\": \\\"kingslanding.sevenkingdoms.local\\\", \\\"keywords\\\": \\\"0x8020000000000000\\\", \\\"level\\\": \\\"0\\\", \\\"providerName\\\": \\\"Microsoft-Windows-Security-Auditing\\\", \\\"processID\\\": \\\"608\\\", \\\"message\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\"An operation was performed on an object.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nSubject :\\\\r\\\\n\\\\tSecurity ID:\\\\t\\\\tS-1-5-18\\\\r\\\\n\\\\tAccount Name:\\\\t\\\\tKINGSLANDING$\\\\r\\\\n\\\\tAccount Domain:\\\\t\\\\tSEVENKINGDOMS\\\\r\\\\n\\\\tLogon ID:\\\\t\\\\t0x1220B8\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nObject:\\\\r\\\\n\\\\tObject Server:\\\\t\\\\tDS\\\\r\\\\n\\\\tObject Type:\\\\t\\\\t%{19195a5b-6da0-11d0-afd3-00c04fd930c9}\\\\r\